    "zh": "老镇中心不许拆，铁路只好沿着它的外圈绕一大圈：先往北，再往东，最后折回南边。三段铁轨首尾相连，把老镇整个围了起来。",
    "en": "The old town centre may not be torn down, so the railway loops right round it: north, then east, then back south. Three stretches of track, joined end to end, wrap the whole old town."
